      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-168563\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-168563\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>The area factor increase based on frontage shall be determined in accordance with Equation 5-5:<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-168564\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-168564\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">I<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">f<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t = (<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">F<\/span>\/<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">P<\/span> - 0.25) <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">W<\/span>\/30&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">(Equation 5-5)<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-168565\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-168565\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>where:<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-168566\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-168566\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;I<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">f<\/span>&#160;&#160;&#160;=&#160;&#160;&#160;Area increase factor due to frontage.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-168567\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-168567\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;F<\/span>&#160;&#160;&#160;=&#160;&#160;&#160;Building perimeter that fronts on a public way or open space having minimum distance of 20 feet (6096 mm).<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-168568\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-168568\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;P<\/span>&#160;&#160;&#160;=&#160;&#160;&#160;Perimeter of entire building (feet).<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-168569\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-168569\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;W<\/span>&#160;&#160;&#160;=&#160;&#160;&#160;Width of public way or open space (feet) in accordance with Section 506.3.2.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>\n<div><span depth=\"6\"><\/span><CodeOptions destID=\"rid-0-0-0-168570\" class=\"Section\"><\/CodeOptions><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-168570\" class=\"Section toc-destination rbox\" style=\"margin-top: .5rem\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-168570\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name=\"JD_BC507\" id=\"JD_BC507\" title=\"BC 507\"><\/a>Section BC 507: Unlimited Area Buildings<\/h6><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
      "id" : "875-html-1",
      "kind" : "html",
      "plainText" : "The area factor increase based on frontage shall be determined in accordance with Equation 5-5:\n\n I f \n\n = ( F \/ P - 0.25) W \/30 (Equation 5-5) \n\n where:\n\n I f = Area increase factor due to frontage.\n\n F = Building perimeter that fronts on a public way or open space having minimum distance of 20 feet (6096 mm).\n\n P = Perimeter of entire building (feet).\n\n W = Width of public way or open space (feet) in accordance with Section 506.3.2.\n\n Section BC 507: Unlimited Area Buildings"
    }
